# Cargo build output for the rewrite crates. The pattern has to cross one more directory level than it
# used to: node crates live under `crates/nodes/<id>/`, and `crates/*/target/` does not match
# `crates/nodes/<id>/target/` because `*` never crosses `/`. Measured while wiring `linedup`: a cold
# standalone build put ~130 MB of untracked output there. A node that is a root workspace member builds
# into `/target` instead, so this line only ever catches the pre-membership window.
crates/**/target/
plugins/*/target/
# Native prebuilt stores are generated per platform by `refresh:native-assets`.
# Only the committed win32-x64 store belongs in the tree; a host that builds its
# own must not accidentally commit ~15MB of zipped binaries.
native/prebuilt/*
!native/prebuilt/README.md
!native/prebuilt/win32-x64
!native/prebuilt/win32-x64/**
src/nodes/marku/__screenshots__/WorkflowMode.browser.test.tsx/
*.png
*.pyc
vendor/neoxide